# The live mirror's round trip, the FM-1's side (tests/host/live_test.sh): a project edited and saved to slot 2, then
# more edits (as the demo build's backup flush saves them: projsave), a page, a track and the SEL list open; its
# backup, its state and its screen. tests/live/page.xy is the page's copy taking them.
wait 3000
master 4096
step 2 1 1 C3 100
step 2 1 5 E3 90
step 2 1 9 G3 110
knob 2 cut 40
track 3
step 3 1 3 A4 100
projsave 2
step 3 1 7 B4 100
track 2
tap EDIT
wait 200
turn SELECT 1
wait 200
tap SEL
wait 300
turn SELECT 2
wait 300
projsave 2
backup out:live.bak
statesave $OUT/live.st
statesig
wait 4000
shot fm1.png
